
<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
	<comment location="PipelineLayoutHandle">
		<summary>
			A PipelineLayout object describes the available binding groups of a pipeline. It can be created with <see cref="WebGpuSharp.Device.CreatePipelineLayout"/>.
		</summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="PipelineLayoutHandle.">
		<comment location="SetLabel">
			<summary>
				Sets the label of the pipeline layout.
			</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>